lass=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_JaheirasHouse_ChildAwayLetter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_JaheirasHouse_ChildAwayLetter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c7f58b5a-5af3-4b2a-92cb-cb55bb3cdf14</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c7f58b5a-5af3-4b2a-92cb-cb55bb3cdf14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c7f58b5a-5af3-4b2a-92cb-cb55bb3cdf14\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Elerrathin%27s_Home\" title=\"Elerrathin's Home\">Elerrathin's Home</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-208&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-50</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">High Harper</a>,\n</p><p><br>\nI'm sorry to report that we've had no leads on the <a href=\"/wiki/Tate\" title=\"Tate\">boy's</a> parents. If they were indeed among the first taken by the cult, then their trail has long gone cold. It's a grim thought, but perhaps they were deemed 'unworthy' of ascending, and sent to serve the cult's purpose in some other way.\n</p><p><br>\nI hope he's settling in there - it may well be he has nowhere else to go.\n</p>\n</div>    